cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, please cite it as below. It changes often,
  so please also give the commit you used. For Principia Mathematica itself,
  cite the book; for errata in its digital texts, cite the companion text
  audit.
type: software
title: "Principia Mathematica in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A deep embedding of Whitehead and Russell's Principia Mathematica (first
  edition, 1910) in Lean 4. Its proofs are derived from PM's own primitive
  propositions and follow PM's Dem. lines, with per-proposition fidelity
  ledgers. It covers propositional logic, apparent variables, ramified types
  with the axiom of reducibility, identity, descriptions, and most of the
  general theory of classes and relations (part of Volume I).
authors:
  - family-names: McGinnis
    given-names: Will
repository-code: "https://github.com/willmcginnis/principia-mathematica-lean"
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - Principia Mathematica
  - Lean 4
  - formalization
  - type theory
  - ramified type theory
  - mathematical logic
